    "title": "Anatomy of an In-Flight Unreliable Airspeed Event: Pitot-Static Probe Ice Crystals, Cockpit Annunciations, and Memory Items",
    "excerpt": "A technical avionics and aeronautical safety investigation into high-altitude ice crystal icing (ICI), pitot probe pressure differentials, flight control primary computer voting logic, and flight crew memory items.",
    "category": "Avionics Safety",
