    "excerpt": "A commercial airfreight logistics case study examining Halifax Stanfield’s multimillion-dollar perishable seafood export corridor, main-deck ULD payload geometry, dry ice sublimation, and live cold-chain logistics.",
    "category": "Air Cargo Logistics",
    "featuredImage": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586528116311-ad8dd3c8310d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80",
